==Problem description==
iPhone 7 Unable to activate issue. It happens after you restore the phone with existing motherboard issues
[[File:Placeholder image.jpg|thumb|Example image (Figure 1) -- No image yet. Help expand this page by uploading it!]]
==Symptoms==
*If a phone has been restored and stuck at the Hello screen
*You try to activate and get the "Unable To Activate" screen
==Solution==
There are 2 potential causes
#Baseband issue. See the Baseband Issues guide for the full breakdown: 
##Click here: [[How To Fix an iPhone 7 That Suddenly Developed a No Service Issue. Baseband Repair]]
#NFC issue. 
##You most likely need to reball or replace NFC_RF